{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Toyohime  $⧼　　⧽  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Hakurei Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A shrine on the outskirts of Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh? Y-you're that Lunarian..."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >Shush!"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm trying to keep a low profile, keep this a secret."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"...So? What are you here for?\""
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >I'll get straight to the point."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That stone you have, ",
                "where did you get it?"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >The Incident Stone you mean?",
                "<l$> Hmmm, I just already had it before I even realized."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >Before you even realized huh...I see."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "One more thing—did you realize that it was the stone that let you avoid the unchanging's influence?"
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hm? What do you mean?"
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >Your responses were what I was hoping to hear."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >Moving on, was Miss Ariya angry?"
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >I'm not really sure, but she looked satisfied."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait a sec, just what are you getting at?"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >...I'm having trouble reporting to the Capital."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I got the answers I was hoping for."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Really now?"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Toyohime  >I can think of no one else but that person who could have crafted the best scenario involving the Capital, the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain, and Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "and now that I've confirmed that, I couldn't ask for more."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >? I don't get it but good for you then."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Before Reimu knew it the Lunarian had already disappeared."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Reimu suddenly felt exhausted. It seems that Lunarians will always will always make her uneasy."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Judging from Toyohime's demeanor, it looks like they'll be fine."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If anything, Toyohime talked as if the Lunar Capital got something out the incident's resolution as well."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even though she's always considered the Lunar Capital as more of an enemy, Reimu is surprised at her own relief."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.06 By That Person, Does She Mean The One In The Bamboo Forest?$>"
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$⧼　　⧽  >While on the topic of Lunarians, that god Ariya said \"I couldn't care less about the Lunarians.\" and abandoned her duties. Are they going to be alright?"
            ]
        }
    }
}